&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;picture&gt;
    &lt;source media=&#34;(prefers-color-scheme: dark)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://github.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/blob/main/resources/logo/web/png/White%20logo%20-%20no%20background.png&#34; width=&#34;50%&#34;&gt;
    &lt;source media=&#34;(prefers-color-scheme: light)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://github.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/raw/main/resources/logo/web/png/Black%20logo%20-%20no%20background.png&#34; width=&#34;50%&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/raw/main/resources/logo/web/png/Black%20logo%20-%20no%20background.png&#34; width=&#34;50%&#34;&gt;
  &lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- omit in toc --&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;paperless-ngx&#34;&gt;Paperless-ngx
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Paperless-ngx is a document management system that transforms your physical documents into a searchable online archive so you can keep, well, &lt;em&gt;less paper&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Paperless-ngx is the official successor to the original &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/the-paperless-project/paperless&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Paperless&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/jonaswinkler/paperless-ng&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Paperless-ng&lt;/a&gt; projects and is designed to distribute the responsibility of advancing and supporting the project among a team of people. &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#community-support&#34; &gt;Consider joining us!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks to the generous folks at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://m.do.co/c/8d70b916d462&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;DigitalOcean&lt;/a&gt;, a demo is available at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://demo.paperless-ngx.com&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;demo.paperless-ngx.com&lt;/a&gt; using login &lt;code&gt;demo&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;demo&lt;/code&gt;. &lt;em&gt;Note: demo content is reset frequently and confidential information should not be uploaded.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#features&#34; &gt;Features&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#getting-started&#34; &gt;Getting started&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#contributing&#34; &gt;Contributing&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#community-support&#34; &gt;Community Support&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#translation&#34; &gt;Translation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#feature-requests&#34; &gt;Feature Requests&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#bugs&#34; &gt;Bugs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#related-projects&#34; &gt;Related Projects&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#important-note&#34; &gt;Important Note&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;right&#34;&gt;This project is supported by:&lt;br/&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://m.do.co/c/8d70b916d462&#34; style=&#34;padding-top: 4px; display: block;&#34;&gt;
    &lt;picture&gt;
      &lt;source media=&#34;(prefers-color-scheme: dark)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://opensource.nyc3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/attribution/assets/SVG/DO_Logo_horizontal_white.svg&#34; width=&#34;140px&#34;&gt;
      &lt;source media=&#34;(prefers-color-scheme: light)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://opensource.nyc3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/attribution/assets/SVG/DO_Logo_horizontal_blue.svg&#34; width=&#34;140px&#34;&gt;
      &lt;img src=&#34;https://opensource.nyc3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/attribution/assets/SVG/DO_Logo_horizontal_black_.svg&#34; width=&#34;140px&#34;&gt;
    &lt;/picture&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;features&#34;&gt;Features
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;picture&gt;
  &lt;source media=&#34;(prefers-color-scheme: dark)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/main/docs/assets/screenshots/documents-smallcards-dark.png&#34;&gt;
  &lt;source media=&#34;(prefers-color-scheme: light)&#34; srcset=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/main/docs/assets/screenshots/documents-smallcards.png&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/main/docs/assets/screenshots/documents-smallcards.png&#34;&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A full list of &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/#features&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;features&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/#screenshots&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;screenshots&lt;/a&gt; are available in the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;documentation&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;getting-started&#34;&gt;Getting started
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to deploy paperless is &lt;code&gt;docker compose&lt;/code&gt;. The files in the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/tree/main/docker/compose&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;code&gt;/docker/compose&lt;/code&gt; directory&lt;/a&gt; are configured to pull the image from the GitHub container registry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&amp;rsquo;d like to jump right in, you can configure a &lt;code&gt;docker compose&lt;/code&gt; environment with our install script:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;bash -c &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;$(&lt;/span&gt;curl -L https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/main/install-paperless-ngx.sh&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;More details and step-by-step guides for alternative installation methods can be found in &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/setup/#installation&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;the documentation&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Migrating from Paperless-ng is easy, just drop in the new docker image! See the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/setup/#migrating-to-paperless-ngx&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;documentation on migrating&lt;/a&gt; for more details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- omit in toc --&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;documentation&#34;&gt;Documentation
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The documentation for Paperless-ngx is available at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://docs.paperless-ngx.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;contributing&#34;&gt;Contributing
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you feel like contributing to the project, please do! Bug fixes, enhancements, visual fixes etc. are always welcome. If you want to implement something big: Please start a discussion about that! The &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/development/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;documentation&lt;/a&gt; has some basic information on how to get started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;community-support&#34;&gt;Community Support
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;People interested in continuing the work on paperless-ngx are encouraged to reach out here on github and in the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://matrix.to/#/#paperless:matrix.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Matrix Room&lt;/a&gt;. If you would like to contribute to the project on an ongoing basis there are multiple &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/orgs/paperless-ngx/people&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;teams&lt;/a&gt; (frontend, ci/cd, etc) that could use your help so please reach out!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;translation&#34;&gt;Translation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Paperless-ngx is available in many languages that are coordinated on Crowdin. If you want to help out by translating paperless-ngx into your language, please head over to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://crowdin.com/project/paperless-ngx&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://crowdin.com/project/paperless-ngx&lt;/a&gt;, and thank you! More details can be found in &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#translating-paperless-ngx&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;CONTRIBUTING.md&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;feature-requests&#34;&gt;Feature Requests
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Feature requests can be submitted via &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/discussions/categories/feature-requests&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;GitHub Discussions&lt;/a&gt;, you can search for existing ideas, add your own and vote for the ones you care about.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;bugs&#34;&gt;Bugs
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For bugs please &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/issues&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;open an issue&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/discussions&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;start a discussion&lt;/a&gt; if you have questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;related-projects&#34;&gt;Related Projects
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please see &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/wiki/Related-Projects&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;the wiki&lt;/a&gt; for a user-maintained list of related projects and software that is compatible with Paperless-ngx.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;important-note&#34;&gt;Important Note
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Document scanners are typically used to scan sensitive documents like your social insurance number, tax records, invoices, etc. &lt;strong&gt;Paperless-ngx should never be run on an untrusted host&lt;/strong&gt; because information is stored in clear text without encryption. No guarantees are made regarding security (but we do try!) and you use the app at your own risk.
&lt;strong&gt;The safest way to run Paperless-ngx is on a local server in your own home with backups in place&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
</description>
